OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-social behaviour crackdown
OL,4,Acomes into force
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeasures aiming to clamp down on
OL,7,Fanti-social behaviour in a Surrey town
OL,8,Fhave taken effect.
OL,10,FWoking Borough Council's public spaces
OL,11,Fprotection order (PSPO) comes into
OL,12,Fforce on Wednesday and is set to last
OL,13,Fthree years - unless extended, changed
OL,14,For removed.
OL,16,FThe order gives police increased powers
OL,17,Fto curb street drinking, intimidating
OL,18,Fand threatening behaviour and people
OL,19,Fusing face coverings to cause fear.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
